{"title": "Extra Reach", "pageid": 244, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Extra_Reach", "categories": ["Weapon Property"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Extra_Reach.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Extra_Reach.jpg/300px-Extra_Reach.jpg.webp, /w/images/2/29/Extra_Reach.jpg 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Extra_Reach.jpg/300px-Extra_Reach.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"85\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/29/Extra_Reach.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Extra Reach</b> is a weapon attribute that allows weapons to have a wider range than other melee weapons.  Characters with <b>Reach Weapons</b> can attack enemies and make an <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack of Opportunity\">Attack of Opportunity</a> from farther away.\n</p>\n<ul><li>The typical range for melee weapons is 1.5 m (5 ft).</li>\n<li><b>Reach Weapons</b> have a melee range of 2.5 m (8 ft).</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_Reach_Weapons\">List of Reach Weapons</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glaives\" title=\"Glaives\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/25px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/38px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/50px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glaives\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/25px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glaives\" title=\"Glaives\">Glaives</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halberds\" title=\"Halberds\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Halberds_Icon.png/25px-Halberds_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Halberds_Icon.png/38px-Halberds_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Halberds_Icon.png/50px-Halberds_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halberds\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Halberds_Icon.png/25px-Halberds_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Halberds_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Halberds\" title=\"Halberds\">Halberds</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pikes\" title=\"Pikes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/25px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/38px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/50px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pikes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/25px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pikes\" title=\"Pikes\">Pikes</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195253\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 592/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2813/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 